{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a land infested by the massive Horde of Viscount</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through both classic-vania stages and regions with exploration where you use subweapons for your advanced movement.\u00a0 Be wary, you only have a limited amount of these subweapons. Instead, you must plan your actions wisely. Use the Dash Knife to attack your enemies from far away? -or perhaps use it to flee?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What else to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty levels available from casual up to souls-bourne-ring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse treacherous arcade stages or exploration stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brag to your friends with a unique high score system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize how you play with equipment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with various merchants in a no economy system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests to improve the town or get new loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expend powerful subweapons to mow down hordes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having trouble on a stage? There are infinite lives, no game overs here!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon to the FULL game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More merchant quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More regions to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More arcade stages to run through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embedded room and item randomizer mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste